[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_TECH]
Science Enlightenment

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_TECH__cost_factor]
Science Enlightenment Policy Cost

[en.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_TECH_desc]


[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_1_MANIAC]
Ode to Tomorrow

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_1_MANIAC_desc]
We stand on the brink of a technological revolution that will fundamentally alter the way we live, work, and relate to one another. In its scale, scope, and complexity, the transformation will be unlike anything creatures of this land have experienced before!

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_2_CHEER]
Enthusiastic Imagination

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_2_CHEER_desc]
“The true sign of intelligence is not knowledge but imagination.” — Dr. Hooves

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_3_NEUTRAL]
Trust and Doubt

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_3_NEUTRAL_desc]
To develop or not to develop, that is the question.

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_4_FEAR]
Fear of Change

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_4_FEAR_desc]
No, you can’t give up progressing
’Cause you’re scared of a little pain
It’s a lesson that no one’ll ever learn

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_5_STAGNATE]
Eternal Stagnation

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_5_STAGNATE_desc]
There will be no new art, no new literature, no new science. When we are omnipotent we shall have no more need of science. There will be no distinction between beauty and ugliness. There will be no curiosity, no enjoyment of the process of life. All competing pleasures will be destroyed.

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_6_DECLINE]
Road to Degradation

[en.IDEA_ERA_TECH_6_DECLINE_desc]
We once had a glorious civilization, but those things did not save us. Science may defeat our enemy, but it cannot defeat time. Time is invincible, and we will gradually forget everything we once knew.

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_TECH]
科学启蒙度

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_TECH__cost_factor]
科学启蒙度花费

[zh.IDEA_CATEGORY_ERA_TECH_desc]


[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_1_MANIAC]
明日颂诗

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_1_MANIAC_desc]
我们站在一场技术革命的边缘，这场革命将从根本上变革我们生活、工作和相互关系的方式。它的范围、规模和复杂性，将超出这片土地上所有生灵此前的经验！

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_2_CHEER]
热情畅想

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_2_CHEER_desc]
“真正的智慧标志不是知识，而是想象力。” — 蹄博士

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_3_NEUTRAL]
将信将疑

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_3_NEUTRAL_desc]
发展还是不发展，这是一个问题。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_4_FEAR]
惧怕改变

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_4_FEAR_desc]
不，你不能放弃进步
只因为你害怕一点点痛苦
这是一个没有谁能学到的教训

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_5_STAGNATE]
永恒停滞

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_5_STAGNATE_desc]
这里不再有新的艺术，不再有新的文学，不再有新的科学。当我们无所不能时，我们将不再需要科学。美丑之分将不复存在。不再有好奇心，不再有对生活过程的享受。所有竞争的快乐都将被摧毁。

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_6_DECLINE]
堕落之途

[zh.IDEA_ERA_TECH_6_DECLINE_desc]
我们曾经拥有辉煌的文明，但是那些东西并没有拯救我们，科学也许可以战胜敌人，但它无法战胜时间。时间是恐怖的，我们会逐渐遗忘曾经所知道的一切。
